== Notes ==
{{anomaly|Unlike [[Distracting Blow]], Distracting Strike deals a damage [[packet]] of zero rather than no damage.}}
* The interrupted skill will be disabled for 30 seconds if its recharge is less than that amount. If its normal recharge is longer than 30 seconds, there is no additional disabling effect.
* Unlike [[Distracting Blow]], [[Order of Pain]] as well as [[Soul Taker]] will increase the damage dealt, and [[Barbs]] will trigger.

